reviews.review:
Pros: 
- Absolutely thrilling and captivating plot;
- Multiple choices to make despite linear storyline; 
- Nice visual design and soundtrack.

Cons: 
- One-time game with little replayability, unless you want to grind all the achievements;
- Sometimes interface can get confusing;
- Fairly short.

I don't regret buying it despite the lack of content; the story is powerful and interesting; you can charge through or sit and deduce, pick your pace and take your time. Orwell is well worth it.
